{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_manager_clustersingletonmanager", "label": "ClusterSingletonManager", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/singleton/manager.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Der Per-Node-Actor, der die Singleton-Wahl-Logik tr\u00e4gt; jeder Node f\u00e4hrt einen, nur der Manager des Hosts hat ein aktives Singleton-Kind."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_manager_host_election", "label": "Der Host ist das erste adressensortierte Up-Mitglied", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/singleton/manager.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Mit Rolle das erste Up-Member, das sie tr\u00e4gt \u2014 nicht \"der Leader, sofern er sie zuf\u00e4llig tr\u00e4gt\", was den Singleton nirgends hosten lie\u00dfe, wenn der Leader sie nicht tr\u00e4gt. Jede Node wendet dieselbe Regel auf ihre eigene Sicht an."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_manager_trigger_events", "label": "Menge der Host-\u00e4ndernden Events", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/singleton/manager.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "MemberJoined und MemberWeaklyUp fehlen bewusst, weil weder joining- noch weakly-up-Mitglieder in upMembers() auftauchen. Vor v0.17.0 war der Trigger allein LeaderChanged, und ein rollentragendes Mitglied unterhalb eines rollenlosen Leaders f\u00fchrte zu zwei lebenden Singletons."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_manager_unreachability_not_trigger", "label": "Unerreichbarkeit ist bewusst kein Trigger", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/singleton/manager.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Jedes Event in der Menge benennt eine Mitgliedschaftstatsache, auf die der Cluster konvergiert; Unerreichbarkeit ist die Aussage eines einzelnen Failure Detectors, und das betroffene Mitglied kann die Peers gar nicht h\u00f6ren. Verf\u00fcgbarkeit ist wiederherstellbar und durch Downing begrenzt, ein zweites lebendes Singleton ist beides nicht."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_manager_no_lease_path", "label": "Pfad ohne Lease", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/singleton/manager.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Der Manager fragt alle berechtigten Peers statt des vorherigen Hosts, weil ein gerade beigetretener Node keine Vorstellung von einem vorherigen Host hat und Beitreten der h\u00e4ufige Fall ist."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_manager_handoverrequest", "label": "singleton.HandOverRequest", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/singleton/manager.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Wird alle halbe Sekunde erneut gesendet, solange sie offen ist, denn ein Cluster-Envelope ist Fire-and-forget."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_manager_handovertimeoutms", "label": "handOverTimeoutMs", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/singleton/manager.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Der Manager hostet nach dem Timeout trotzdem: die Einzigartigkeits-Invariante wurde nicht bewiesen \u2014 was etwas anderes ist als eingehalten."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_manager_lease_path", "label": "Pfad mit Lease", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/singleton/manager.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Interne Events statt inline awaits, sodass parallele Cluster-Events sich nicht mit einem laufenden Acquire verschr\u00e4nken."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_manager_lease_lost", "label": "Lease verloren", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/singleton/manager.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Vor v0.17.0 wurde sofort neu erworben, und die Folge waren nicht zwei Instanzen, sondern keine: der Manager erneuerte dauerhaft eine Lease \u00fcber gar keinen Singleton."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_manager_restartontermination", "label": "restartOnTermination als Verriegelung", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/singleton/manager.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Muss eine Verriegelung sein statt blo\u00df fehlender Trigger, weil \"ich bin der Host und habe kein Kind\" einen Endzustand nicht von \"nie gestartet\" unterscheiden kann."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_manager_message_hold", "label": "Nachrichten halten, w\u00e4hrend der Manager gew\u00e4hlt ist, aber keine Instanz hat", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/singleton/manager.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Auf 1000 Nachrichten und zwei Sekunden begrenzt; das Halten h\u00e4ngt nicht daran, dass der Manager sich selbst als Host sieht \u2014 das Fenster existiert gerade deshalb, weil er das noch nicht tut."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_manager_handover_authorization", "label": "Wer einen Hand-over verlangen darf", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/singleton/manager.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Nur von einer transport-verifizierten Adresse, und ein Node, der sich f\u00fcr den Host h\u00e4lt, tritt nur f\u00fcr einen Peer zur\u00fcck, der vor ihm sortiert."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_manager_child_death_watch", "label": "Das Kind beobachten", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/singleton/manager.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Eine Sekunde Backoff vor dem Neuspawnen, weil ein sofortiges Neuspawnen das ersch\u00f6pfte Supervisions-Budget zur\u00fccksetzen und aus einem crash-loopenden Singleton eine hei\u00dfe Schleife machen w\u00fcrde."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_manager_clustersingletonmanager", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_manager_host_election", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/singleton/manager.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_manager_clustersingletonmanager", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_manager_trigger_events", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/singleton/manager.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_manager_trigger_events", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_manager_unreachability_not_trigger", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/singleton/manager.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_manager_clustersingletonmanager", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_manager_no_lease_path", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/singleton/manager.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_manager_no_lease_path", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_manager_handoverrequest", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/singleton/manager.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_manager_no_lease_path", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_manager_handovertimeoutms", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/singleton/manager.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_manager_clustersingletonmanager", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_manager_lease_path", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/singleton/manager.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_manager_lease_path", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_manager_lease_lost", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/singleton/manager.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_manager_clustersingletonmanager", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_manager_child_death_watch", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/singleton/manager.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_manager_child_death_watch", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_manager_restartontermination", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/singleton/manager.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_manager_clustersingletonmanager", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_manager_message_hold", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/singleton/manager.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_manager_handoverrequest", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_manager_handover_authorization", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/singleton/manager.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_manager_handovertimeoutms", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_manager_unreachability_not_trigger", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/singleton/manager.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_manager_clustersingletonmanager", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_overview_cluster_singleton", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/singleton/manager.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_manager_lease_path", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_with_lease_singleton_with_lease", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/singleton/manager.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_singleton_manager_clustersingletonmanager", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_manager_clustersingletonmanager", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/singleton/manager.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_singleton_manager_unreachability_not_trigger", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_manager_unreachability_not_trigger", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/singleton/manager.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_cluster_singleton_manager_message_hold", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_manager_message_hold", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/singleton/manager.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_worker_mesh_restart_budget", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_manager_child_death_watch", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/singleton/manager.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_rebalance_directive_authorization", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_manager_handover_authorization", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "c